---
// Engineering & Compliance Section - Split Technical Layout
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section id="engineering" class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-background border-b border-border" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:iu3a76">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:v87d17">
      <!-- 7/12 Narrative & Code Breakdown -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:v87d18">
        <h2 class="text-h2 font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:h3c9cg">
          Quality Confirmed — ICC Approved & Industry Trusted
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:wcdy39">
          Seismic restraint is not just about raw steel; it is about verified engineering calculations that withstand regulatory scrutiny and protect critical assets during seismic movement.
        </p>

        <p class="text-sm md:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:wcdy3a">
          9.0 SeismicCo works directly with builders, architects, and structural engineering teams to verify code compliance under current International Building Code (IBC) and ASCE 7 provisions. Every bracket profile undergoes stringent testing to assure proper ductility, tensile strength, and shear capacity.
        </p>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:v87d19">
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:v87d1a">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:2exc46">ICC Code Standard</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:wcdy3b">
              Calculated and documented for fast building inspector sign-off on commercial and healthcare jobs.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvg6">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:2exc47">Full Traceability</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:wcdy3c">
              Mill-certified materials with verified batch numbers and stamped load ratings on every bracket assembly.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvg5">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:2exc4t">Contractor Fast-Track</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:wcdy3d">
              Standardized bolt holes eliminate field cutting, welding, and torching, ensuring clean inspection results.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-surface border border-border rounded-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvg4">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-foreground mb-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:2exc4u">Direct Engineering Support</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:wcdy3e">
              Technical advisory team available to assist with anchorage calculations and custom bracket sizing.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5/12 Supporting Imagery & Compliance Proof Box -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvg3">
        <div class="bg-surface border border-border p-6 rounded-sm shadow-sm" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvg2">
          <div class="relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-dark-background border border-border mb-6" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvg1">
            <img
              src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/6627667/pexels-photo-6627667.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200"
              alt="Hospital laboratory equipment seismic anchoring safety validation"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
              loading="lazy"
              width="600"
              height="450" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:spy8pp" />
          </div>

          <h3 class="text-h3 font-bold text-foreground mb-2" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:2exc4v">
            Engineered for Extreme Loads
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-4" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:wcdy3f">
            Our anchoring configurations are engineered to prevent equipment overturn, line rupture, and non-structural damage across major seismic zones.
          </p>

          <div class="p-3 bg-background border-l-2 border-primary text-xs font-mono text-foreground space-y-1" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvg0">
            <div class="flex justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvfz">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:pc63ak">Compliance standard:</span>
              <span class="font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:pc63aj">IBC 2021 / 2024</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvfy">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:pc63ai">Non-structural criteria:</span>
              <span class="font-bold" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:pc63ah">ASCE 7-16 / 7-22</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex justify-between" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:hbmvfx">
              <span class="text-muted-foreground" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:pc63ag">Documentation:</span>
              <span class="font-bold text-primary" data-ps="src/components/home/Engineering.astro:pc639u">Pre-Approved Submittals</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
